Litematica for Horizon

Inspired by Litematica by masa (https://github.com/maruohon/litematica),
which is licensed under the GNU LGPL v3. This mod is a separate
implementation written for Horizon: it reads and writes the .litematic file
format so schematics made with Litematica on Java Edition work here, but it
contains no code from Litematica.

"Litematica" is masa's project name; this port is not made or endorsed by
masa.
